        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho arambarira, ati Genda uhagarare mu kirimba gihitamw’ abantu bose, ari co abami b’Abayuda bahora bacamw’ amaja n’amaza, uhagarare no ku birimba bindi vyose vy’i Yerusalemu, ",
