        },
        {
          "text": "ubabgire, uti Ni mwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho, mwebge bami b’i Buyuda na Buyuda bgose, n’ababa i Yerusalemu mwese, abaca mur’ ibi birimba; ",
          "type": "text",
