          "text": "kandi ntimukagire icikorerwa musohokana mu nzu zanyu ku musi w’isabato, kandi ntimugire igikorwa na kimwe muwukorako: ariko muziririze umusi w’isabato, nk’uko nageze ba sogokuruza; ",
